title: Emergency Conference
subtitle: The SPD holds an emergency party conference in Magdeburg to address the leadership vacancy.
view-if: spd_coleader_1 == "vacant" or spd_coleader_2 == "vacant" or spd_coleader_3 == "vacant" 
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 3

- @the_matter_of_the_leadership: Now onto the final issue, the matter of the leadership. 

@the_matter_of_the_leadership

How does our leadership fare at the Conference?

- @co_leader_1: How does [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], of the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction, fare?

@co_leader_1

How does [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], of the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction, fare?

- @co_leader_1_challenge: [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] faces a challenge!
- @co_leader_1_no_challenge: [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] faces no challenge.

@co_leader_1_challenge
view-if: (center_c < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "center") or (left_c < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "left") or (reformist_c < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "reformist") or (labor_c < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "labor") or (neorevisionist_c < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "neorevisionist") or (spd_coleader_1_faction == "non-factional")

[+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +] has come under challenge at the Conference! They will attempt to survive the challenge, but their victory is far from guaranteed. Who wins the vote?

- @incumbent_1: The incumbent, [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], wins in a victory for the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction!
- @left_1: [+ left_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Left faction!
- @center_1: [+ center_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Center faction!
- @labor_1: [+ labor_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Labor faction!
- @reformist_1: [+ reformist_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Reformist faction!
- @neorevisionist_1: [+ neorevisionist_leader_fullname +] wins in a victory for the Neorevisionist faction!

@incumbent_1
view-if: spd_coleader_1 != "vacant"
choose-if: (left_c >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "left") or (left_c >= labor_c and (left_c+labor_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "left") or (left_c < 50 and labor_c < 50 and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "center") or (labor_c >= 50) or (labor_c >= left_c and (labor_c+left_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "labor") or (labor_c >= reformist_c and labor_c >= neorevisionist_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "labor") or (labor_c >= center_c and (labor_c+center_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "labor") or (reformist_c >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "reformist") or (reformist_c >= neorevisionist_c and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "reformist") or (reformist_c >= neorevisionist_c and reformist_c >= labor_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "reformist") or (neorevisionist_c >= 50) or (neorevisionist_c >= reformist_c and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "neorevisionist") or (neorevisionist_c >= reformist_c and neorevisionist_c >= labor_c and (labor_c+reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) >= 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "neorevisionist") or (left_c < 50 and labor_c < 50 and (reformist_c+neorevisionist_c) < 50 and spd_coleader_1_faction == "non-factional")

The incumbent, [+ spd_coleader_1_fullname +], wins in a victory for the [+ spd_coleader_1_faction +] faction!

- @co_leader_2: How does [+ spd_coleader_2_fullname +], of the [+ spd_coleader_2_faction +] faction, fare?

@left_1
view-if: spd_coleader_1_faction != "left"
choose-if: (left_c >= 50) or (left_c >= labor_c and (left_c+labor_c) >= 50) or (left_leader == "Baade") or (left_leader == "Hirschfeld") or (left_leader == "Radbruch") or (left_leader == "Stampfer")
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.left_leader == "Crispien") {
    Q.spd_coleader_1 = "Crispien";
    Q.spd_coleader_1_fullname = "Arthur Crispien";
